+    /**
+     * Introspection method for checking whether this deserializer is able to
+     * enumerate names of all properties it may handle, via
+     * {@link #collectAllPropertyNamesTo}. Needed for "unwrapped" (see
+     * {@link com.fasterxml.jackson.annotation.JsonUnwrapped}) handling: if
+     * deserializer cannot enumerate names, all otherwise unrecognized properties
+     * need to be passed to it (as with "any setter").
+     *<p>
+     * Default implementation returns {@code false} since default implementation
+     * of {@link #collectAllPropertyNamesTo} adds no names.
+     *
+     * @since 3.2
